 ## Unreleased
 
+- The month-end report lists the top 10 payees instead of 5; `report month --top N`
+  chooses another number.
 - Refunds (money back into a spending category) now reduce that category's spending in
   `budget status` and the month-end report instead of being ignored.
 - New transactions are appended to the transactions file instead of rewriting it sorted
